  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<div>The polygons are interpreted using orthophotography and assigned a land use code, natural heritage land uses are then further attributed based on the Ecological Land Classification (ELC).</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>The Lake Simcoe Watershed Land Cover dataset is open data and available at the Lake Simcoe Region Conservation Authority’s Open Data Portal: <a target='_blank' href='https://lsrca-open-data-camaps.opendata.arcgis.com/datasets/camaps::landcover-2013/about' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Landcover 2013</a> (English only).</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'><strong>Status</strong></span><br />&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Completed: production of the data has been completed</span><br />&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'><strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency</strong></span><br />&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>As needed: data is updated as deemed necessary</span><br />&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'><strong>Contact</strong></span><br />&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Julia Haan, </span><a href='mailto:julia.haan@ontario.ca' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>julia.haan@ontario.ca</span></a></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline